{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Bound Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../Message.view/", "title": "Message.view()"}, "next": {"link": "../Message.pay/", "title": "Message.pay()"}, "title": "Message.translate()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"message-translate\">\n<h1>Message.translate()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#message-translate\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.Message.translate\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Message.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">translate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.Message.translate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bound method <em>translate</em> of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/Message/#pyrogram.types.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a>.</p>\n<p>Use as a shortcut for:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">translate_message_text</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chat</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">message_ids</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">message_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">to_language_code</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;en&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">translate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;en&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>to_language_code</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Language code of the language to which the message is translated.\nMust be one of \u201caf\u201d, \u201csq\u201d, \u201cam\u201d, \u201car\u201d, \u201chy\u201d, \u201caz\u201d, \u201ceu\u201d, \u201cbe\u201d, \u201cbn\u201d, \u201cbs\u201d, \u201cbg\u201d, \u201cca\u201d, \u201cceb\u201d, \u201czh-CN\u201d, \u201czh\u201d, \u201czh-Hans\u201d, \u201czh-TW\u201d, \u201czh-Hant\u201d, \u201cco\u201d, \u201chr\u201d, \u201ccs\u201d, \u201cda\u201d, \u201cnl\u201d, \u201cen\u201d, \u201ceo\u201d, \u201cet\u201d, \u201cfi\u201d, \u201cfr\u201d, \u201cfy\u201d, \u201cgl\u201d, \u201cka\u201d, \u201cde\u201d, \u201cel\u201d, \u201cgu\u201d, \u201cht\u201d, \u201cha\u201d, \u201chaw\u201d, \u201che\u201d, \u201ciw\u201d, \u201chi\u201d, \u201chmn\u201d, \u201chu\u201d, \u201cis\u201d, \u201cig\u201d, \u201cid\u201d, \u201cin\u201d, \u201cga\u201d, \u201cit\u201d, \u201cja\u201d, \u201cjv\u201d, \u201ckn\u201d, \u201ckk\u201d, \u201ckm\u201d, \u201crw\u201d, \u201cko\u201d, \u201cku\u201d, \u201cky\u201d, \u201clo\u201d, \u201cla\u201d, \u201clv\u201d, \u201clt\u201d, \u201clb\u201d, \u201cmk\u201d, \u201cmg\u201d, \u201cms\u201d, \u201cml\u201d, \u201cmt\u201d, \u201cmi\u201d, \u201cmr\u201d, \u201cmn\u201d, \u201cmy\u201d, \u201cne\u201d, \u201cno\u201d, \u201cny\u201d, \u201cor\u201d, \u201cps\u201d, \u201cfa\u201d, \u201cpl\u201d, \u201cpt\u201d, \u201cpa\u201d, \u201cro\u201d, \u201cru\u201d, \u201csm\u201d, \u201cgd\u201d, \u201csr\u201d, \u201cst\u201d, \u201csn\u201d, \u201csd\u201d, \u201csi\u201d, \u201csk\u201d, \u201csl\u201d, \u201cso\u201d, \u201ces\u201d, \u201csu\u201d, \u201csw\u201d, \u201csv\u201d, \u201ctl\u201d, \u201ctg\u201d, \u201cta\u201d, \u201ctt\u201d, \u201cte\u201d, \u201cth\u201d, \u201ctr\u201d, \u201ctk\u201d, \u201cuk\u201d, \u201cur\u201d, \u201cug\u201d, \u201cuz\u201d, \u201cvi\u201d, \u201ccy\u201d, \u201cxh\u201d, \u201cyi\u201d, \u201cji\u201d, \u201cyo\u201d, \u201czu\u201d.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/TranslatedText/#pyrogram.types.TranslatedText\" title=\"pyrogram.types.TranslatedText\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TranslatedText</span></code></a> \u2013 The translated result is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>RPCError</strong> \u2013 In case of a Telegram RPC error.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/bound-methods/Message.pay", "Message.pay()", "N", "next"], ["api/bound-methods/Message.view", "Message.view()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Message.translate()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.Message.translate\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message.translate()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/bound-methods/Message.translate", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}